    <h2>FAQ</h2>

    <h3>Is Midjourney better than DALL-E 3?</h3>
    <p>Midjourney is better for artistic quality, cinematic visuals, and fine-grained creative control through parameters like aspect ratio, style, and chaos. DALL-E 3 is better for prompt accuracy, ease of use, and generating images with legible text. For portfolio work and concept art, Midjourney wins. For quick drafts and literal scene depiction, DALL-E 3 wins.</p>

    <h3>Which is cheaper, Midjourney or DALL-E 3?</h3>
    <p>Midjourney Basic starts at $10 per month for approximately 200 images, while DALL-E 3 is bundled with ChatGPT Plus at $20 per month. If you only need image generation, Midjourney is cheaper. If you also use GPT-4, code interpretation, and web browsing, ChatGPT Plus offers better overall value because DALL-E 3 is included at no extra cost.</p>

    <h3>Can DALL-E 3 generate text in images?</h3>
    <p>Yes, DALL-E 3 is significantly better at rendering legible text in images compared to Midjourney. DALL-E 3 can spell words, phrases, and short sentences with reasonable accuracy, making it the better choice for logos, signage, and marketing mockups. Midjourney still struggles with text and often produces garbled or invented characters.</p>

    <h3>Do Midjourney and DALL-E 3 allow commercial use?</h3>
    <p>Yes, both Midjourney and DALL-E 3 allow commercial use on paid plans. Midjourney grants commercial usage rights on Basic, Standard, Pro, and Mega plans, though free trial images cannot be used commercially. DALL-E 3 images generated through ChatGPT Plus are fully owned by the user and can be used commercially without restrictions.</p>

    <h3>Which is faster, Midjourney or DALL-E 3?</h3>
    <p>DALL-E 3 is faster, typically generating images in 10 to 20 seconds. Midjourney takes about 60 seconds per image on default settings, and up to several minutes on quality mode or with upscaling. For rapid iteration and drafting, DALL-E 3 wins on speed. For final polished artwork, Midjourney's longer render time produces higher quality output.</p>

    <h3>Can I use Midjourney and DALL-E 3 together?</h3>
    <p>Yes, and many professional creators do. A common workflow is to use DALL-E 3 inside ChatGPT to draft concepts, refine composition, and test ideas quickly, then move the final prompt to Midjourney for cinematic rendering, style refinement, and high-resolution upscaling. The combined monthly cost is around $30, which is still less than a single commissioned illustration.</p>

